  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Fade_Widow.png\" title=\"Fire Fade Widow\"><img alt=\"Fire Fade Widow\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/recovered/Fade_Widow.png\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Fade_Widow.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Fire Fade Widow</div></div></div>\n<p>Fade Widows appear as giant spiders.   Perhaps they are grown up <a href=\"/wiki/Fade_Hatchling\" title=\"Fade Hatchling\">Fade Hatchlings</a>.  They are usually accompanied by <a href=\"/wiki/Fade_Lichlord\" title=\"Fade Lichlord\">Fade Lichlords</a>.\n</p><p><b>Race:</b> Fade\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Fighter\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fire Fade Widow\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Toe-Tnee-Eye-Ow-My-Eye's_Pad\" title=\"Toe-Tnee-Eye-Ow-My-Eye's Pad\">Toe-Tnee-Eye-Ow-My-Eye's Pad</a> off <a href=\"/wiki/The_Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"The Mutanous Malaise\">The Mutanous Malaise</a> Level 7.\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
